{"id":"ubedit_sya","lemma":"убедиться","pos":"verb","rank":753,"glosses":["to be convinced, to receive evidence","to make sure, to make certain"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/53/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"убежусь","2s":"убедишься","3s":"убедится","1p":"убедимся","2p":"убедитесь","3p":"убедятся"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"убедись","2p":"убедитесь"}}},"past":{"m":"убедился","p":"убедились","f":"убедилась","n":"убедилось"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"убеждаться","examples":[{"text":"Я должен убедиться.","en":"I must be sure.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},null]},{"text":"Вы скоро убедитесь, что я прав.","en":"You will soon be convinced I am right.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"soon"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Я должен убедиться, дома ли он.","en":"I must make sure whether he is at home or not.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},null,{"g":"at home"},{"g":"whether (question)"},{"g":"he / it"}]},{"text":"Убедись, что ты никого не забыл.","en":"Make sure that you don't forget anybody.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"забыть"}]},{"text":"Я просто хотел убедиться.","en":"I just wanted to make sure.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null]}]}